 false, "body": "こんにちは！(*^^*)イラストがとても好きです!\n私のFFXIVのキャラクターがこの服を着ている絵をお願いしたいです！https://imgur.com/a/hHq5r6O\n私のXIVキャラクター： https://imgur.com/a/RkkqCz9\n幸せそうな表情を描いてください\nポーズは自由です\n\nご検討よろしくお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@purin_uni3/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e31a5f52/uploads/origins/04d8b626-e658-4c53-bbbf-d65674298325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf69d3dafd91d56bc7b5bb0201760817", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e31a5f52/uploads/origins/04d8b626-e658-4c53-bbbf-d65674298325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf69d3dafd91d56bc7b5bb0201760817, https://si.imgix.net/e31a5f52/uploads/origins/04d8b626-e658-4c53-bbbf-d65674298325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ab21abb666e603339cc40495d3de0d6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e31a5f52/uploads/origins/04d8b626-e658-4c53-bbbf-d65674298325?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d83eadeab9e8869f1090143e415c06f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\n素敵なイラスト拝見いたしましてご依頼のほうさせていただきたいと思いました！\n今回PSO２というオンラインゲームの自キャラをお願いしたいと思ってます。\nキャラクターイメージはお姫様になります。\nhttps://t.co/hUBeC5b6bF\nよろしければご検討の程よろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@purin_uni3/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20cbd142/uploads/origins/590e374a-1919-48a5-bbdb-ca08d6381a6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd28042d917b8106e79783073b199fc3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/20cbd142/uploads/origins/590e374a-1919-48a5-bbdb-ca08d6381a6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bd28042d917b8106e79783073b199fc3, https://si.imgix.net/20cbd142/uploads/origins/590e374a-1919-48a5-bbdb-ca08d6381a6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8eb83ad023af1af3d62cc8618ae41e06 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20cbd142/uploads/origins/590e374a-1919-48a5-bbdb-ca08d6381a6b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aeb373c000c09e653d8b61e66781ce1c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! Can you please draw our character, KAMEN AMERICA, in a vertical format with full body?\n\n- Please have her wear the red, white, and blue dirndl (German dress). Have the shirt be red and white stripes— for the details, use gold or white stars\n\n- Have her hair in pigtails but keep her ahoge\n\n- Have her leggings be red and white stripes\n\n- Keep her mask on, and smiling\n\n- For the background, it is a German Oktoberfest hall\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/sh/ayjdcuj3kir0dry/AADg3V_Y-gKNYlbl0EgS1gy-a?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@purin_uni3/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f14fdeb2/requests/58760_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34e2a7cd632527bfa455eec909d32843", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f14fdeb2/requests/58760_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34e2a7cd632527bfa455eec909d32843, https://si.imgix.net/f14fdeb2/requests/58760_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a3f553c059e3de06e742c4511855ddf4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f14fdeb2/requests/58760_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e9ef8e334c366afd95b9db7ef1d40940 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "https://twitter.com/_shunao/status/1188208731026317312\n\nこれは、ツナオでシュナオが作ったオリジナルのキャラクターです。あなたのスタイルで彼女を描く時間があれば、私はとても幸せです", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@purin_uni3/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bebe7f2b/requests/14831_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ce2e3dd638247dbc1586c66719b0595", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bebe7f2b/requests/14831_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompres